{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01LoAszLumjrj7ypirc1YhbW","type":"tool_result","content":"#!/bin/sh\n# Build everything the differential tests need, then run them.\n#   ./check.sh                 -- all tests\n#   ./check.sh --test errors   -- one test target\nset -e\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\nif [ ! -f c_src/build/libpng.so ]; then\n    mkdir -p c_src/build\n    (cd c_src/build && cmake .. -DCMAKE_POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE=ON >/dev/null && cmake --build . -j8 >/dev/null)\nfi\ncargo build --offline --release\nexec cargo test --offline --release \"$@\"\n30:| A. entry-point family | low-level write · low-level sequential read · high-level `png_read_png`/`png_write_png` · progressive read (`png_process_data`) · simplified read (`png_image_*read*`) · simplified write (`png_image_write_*`) · raw chunk writer (`png_write_chunk*`) · info get/set only · pure/util functions · internal (non-`png.h`) exports | `png.h`, `pngpriv.h` |\n186:| C-131 | `png_read_png` | every transform flag valid on read, singly and in random combinations, over every shape; params NULL | [ ] |\n187:| C-132 | `png_write_png` | every transform flag valid on write, singly and in random combinations, over every shape | [ ] |\n188:| C-133 | `png_read_png + png_write_png` | round trip: read with T, write with T, over random shapes | [ ] |\n321:| C-107 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n322:| C-108 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n323:| C-109 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n324:| C-110 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n325:| C-111 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n326:| C-112 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n327:| C-113 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n328:| C-114 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n329:| C-115 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n330:| C-116 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n331:| C-117 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n332:| C-118 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n333:| C-119 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n334:| C-120 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n335:| C-121 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n336:| C-122 | `chunks::round_trip` |\n337:| C-123 | `chunks::r