{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_dyzifzvghewwjtycfmsldhmzzxxjz5vpdvxvch6mkiy5q3pdzkgq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_018NPUc7ADyJiLSMzhHpN7Rj","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-CVzjKq/translated_rust/tests/errors_deep.rs","old_string":"//! * `pngset.c:1832` \"Compression buffer size limited to system maximum\" —\n//!   `if (size > ZLIB_IO_MAX) { png_warning(...); size = ZLIB_IO_MAX; }` where\n//!   `ZLIB_IO_MAX` is `((uInt)-1)` = 4294967295 (pngstruct.h:53).  A `size_t`\n//!   larger than that *is* representable on this target, so this one is\n//!   reachable — and `errors.rs::write_option_errors` already reaches it with\n//!   `png_set_compression_buffer_size(png, usize::MAX)`.  It is listed here only\n//!   because on a 32-bit `size_t` the comparison would be the dead one.\n//!\n//! Three more of the targeted sites are dead for a different reason, each\n//! documented on the test that pins down what happens instead:\n//!\n//! * `pngrutil.c:211` \"bad header (invalid length)\" — shadowed by the identical\n//!   condition inside `png_get_uint_31`, 14 lines earlier; see\n//!   `chunk_header_invalid_length`.\n//! * `pngwutil.c:1148` \"Profile length does not match profile\" — shadowed by the\n//!   literally identical `if` at pngwutil.c:1137; see `iccp_write_direct`.\n//! * `pngrutil.c:1635` \"sPLT chunk too long\" — a 64-bit `PNG_SIZE_MAX`\n//!   comparison against a value bounded by the chunk length; see\n//!   `splt_chunk_cache`.","new_string":"//! Four more of the targeted sites are dead for a different reason: an earlier\n//! test in the *same* function already rejects every input that could reach\n//! them.  Each is documented on the test that pins down what happens instead:\n//!\n//! * `pngrutil.c:211` \"bad header (invalid length)\" — shadowed by the identical\n//!   condition inside `png_get_uint_31`, 14 lines earlier; see\n//!   `chunk_header_invalid_length`.\n//! * `pngwutil.c:1148` \"Profile length does not match profile\" — shadowed by the\n//!   literally identical `if` at pngwutil.c:1137; see `iccp_write_direct`.\n//! * `pngrutil.c:1635` \"sPLT chunk too long\" — a 64-bit `PNG_SIZE_MAX`\n//!   comparison against a value bounded by the chunk length; see\n//!   `splt_chunk_cache`.\n//! * `pngset.c:1832` \"Compression buffer size limited to system maximum\" — see\n//!   `compression_buffer_size_system_maximum`."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":429309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":436,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Q2LumuFA2ZNcudyRk6z47M","session_id":"309de29f-cb7a-4138-9016-7ab2e7ef6079","uuid":"26eb86c7-f266-40c6-a1e0-022b648c5c8f","timestamp":"2026-08-23T04:46:41.642Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Close remaining error-surface gaps"}
